        "$3-1\\frac{3}{7}=3-1-\\frac{3}{7}=2-\\frac{3}{7}=1\\frac{4}{7}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例3. 求$2\\frac{3}{5}+1\\frac{1}{4}$的值：",
        "$2\\frac{3}{5}+1\\frac{1}{4}=2+\\frac{3}{5}+1+\\frac{1}{4}=3+\\frac{3}{5}+\\frac{1}{4}↵=3+\\frac{17}{20}=3\\frac{17}{20}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例4. 求$4\\frac{1}{6}-1\\frac{3}{4}$的值：",
        "$4\\frac{1}{6}-1\\frac{3}{4}=3+\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{3}{4}=3+\\frac{4-18}{6\\cdot4}↵=3+\\frac{-14}{6\\cdot4}=3-\\frac{7}{12}=2\\frac{5}{12}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例5. 求$-2\\frac{3}{10}+1\\frac{2}{15}$的值：",
        "$-2\\frac{3}{10}+1\\frac{2}{15}=-2-\\frac{3}{10}+1+\\frac{2}{15}=-1+\\frac{-3}{10}+\\frac{2}{5}↵=-1+\\frac{-25}{10\\cdot15}=-1-\\frac{1}{6}=-1\\frac{1}{6}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1006",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1006. 叙述加法交换律，用变量$a$和$b$把它写出来并用$a=↵\\frac{5}{6}$，$b=\\frac{1}{4}$加以验证."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1007",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
